# Secrets and runtime state must never enter the build context. `data/` holds the
# live SurrealKV file and the bootstrap superuser record, and `.env` holds the
# deployment secrets; both are mounted/read at runtime instead. `.env.example`
# is deliberately kept (it is the committed reference).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data
**/data/planinc.db

